B.aiq=new A.lp("SEARCH & DISCOVERY","Build precise Wikimedia Commons searches without learning CirrusSearch syntax.",B.X3)
B.Yt=s(["Include or exclude Wikidata depicts subjects and combine several subjects with AND or OR logic.","Search arbitrary Wikidata property-value statements with independent include and exclude rules.","Include or exclude multiple Commons categories, switch between AND and OR, and recursively include subcategories.","Filter by MediaWiki templates, language, content model, creation and edit dates, resolution, file size, and color depth.","Restrict results to standard Creative Commons, GFDL, Free Art, and public-domain statuses, plus attribution status or Commons quality assessments."],t.s)
B.air=new A.lp("SEMANTIC & METADATA FILTERS","Use Commons categories and structured Wikidata metadata as first-class search controls.",B.Yt)
B.XA=s(["Search by tapping a map, choosing a circular radius, or searching near a named place.","Plot the current search on a map, cluster thumbnail markers, inspect clusters, and open results in a split-screen grid.","Use multilingual street, English-labelled street, satellite, and hybrid layers with zoom, rotation, north reset, camera fitting, and responsive mobile controls.","Carry search context into the map, apply license, quality, and attribution filters, or send a map query back to Search."],t.s)
B.ais=new A.lp("MAP & LOCATION SEARCH","Discover geotagged Commons media spatially instead of relying only on words.",B.XA)
B.ZM=s(["View images, vectors, audio, video, and supported PDFs natively, with browser fallbacks for DjVu and unsupported files.","Navigate result galleries by swipe, buttons, or keyboard and switch images between a web-optimized and full-resolution preview.","Read creator, uploader, dates, dimensions, categories, assessments, coordinates, Structured Data on Commons, and global usage.","Find related files, explore nearby geotagged media, and browse every upload from a contributor portfolio.","Generate copy-ready plain-text attribution, HTML, and WikiText with links to the source, license, and official reuse guidance."],t.s)
B.ait=new A.lp("MEDIA VIEWER & REUSE","Inspect, understand, credit, and download a Commons file from one viewer.",B.ZM)
B.XS=s(["Download originals or 640px, 1280px, and 1920px derivatives when available.","Long-press result cards, select any subset or all loaded files, and export originals or 1280px web-optimized media as ZIP files.","Track, cancel, and run multiple downloads while large selections are split into manageable archive parts.","Receive a data.csv manifest with every bulk ZIP, including source URLs, descriptions, dimensions, rights, attribution, dates, categories, assessments, and coordinates."],t.s)
B.aip=new A.lp("DOWNLOADS & DATA EXPORT","Move from discovery to a reusable media collection entirely in the browser.",B.XS)
B.ZR=s(["Start from text, categories, depicted subjects, Wikidata statements, templates, geosearch, author uploads, or a related file.","Filter license, quality, format, resolution, size, color depth, dates, language, and excluded terms.","Combine branches with query constraints, union, intersection, or difference; then deduplicate, sort, sample, select fields, or enrich metadata.","Preview intermediate results and send outputs to CSV, JSON, ZIP, a media preview, or the main Search grid.","Autosave pipelines in IndexedDB, reopen saved graphs, import or export portable JSON, preview capped runs, cache queries, and clear cached results."],t.s)
