B.Zy=s(["Use clean deep links for searches, assets, authors, maps, directories, pipelines, and this feature guide.","Install CommonsLens as a standalone web app on supported devices and use desktop or mobile-specific layouts.","Benefit from lazy metadata loading, staggered result rendering, request deduplication, Wikimedia-aware throttling, retries, and cancellable transfers.","No Commons account is required, and CommonsLens does not host or claim ownership of the media it displays."],t.s)
